"# Survey & Investigation Report: Frontend Entry Points & Lifecycle Keepalive (R2)

**Core Finding**: The production frontend entry points (`app/js/config.js` and `app/js/app.js`) currently have critical lifecycle and resolution gaps compared to the validated PoC (`poc/`): (1) `app/js/config.js` has a priority inversion where URL query parameters overwrite webOS `PalmSystem.launchParams`, (2) `app/index.html` omits `webOSTV.js`, leaving `window.webOS` undefined on-device, and (3) `app/js/app.js` issues a one-shot `ping` rather than establishing a persistent Luna keepalive subscription hook (`subscribe: true`), which risks OS termination of the on-device background service daemon.

